cff-version: 1.2.0
title: groundlens
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. Note that performance figures
  published by this project before v3.0.0 have been withdrawn and should not
  be cited.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Marin
    given-names: Javier
repository-code: https://github.com/groundlens-dev/groundlens
url: https://groundlens.dev
abstract: >-
  Guardrails for LLM answers. GroundLens checks an LLM answer against its
  sources without a model, decides PASS, REVIEW or FAIL under your policy, and
  keeps a signed record. The exact checks cover figures, arithmetic, the
  entity each figure comes from and the kind of answer asked for; a judge,
  the user's own model, is optional and can only escalate. Every decision is
  sealed in a signed, hash-chained record that anyone can verify offline.
license: Apache-2.0
version: 5.3.0
date-released: '2026-09-22'
